# would turn `pnpm format` and `pnpm check-skills` into two gates that cannot
# both be green — and the resolution would be to un-format a file this
# repository does not own. They already match this configuration today; that is
# a coincidence of two repositories sharing a .prettierrc, not a guarantee.
